{"id":"n61757-2-4","stage":5,"title":"빼내다 · 挑出","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61757-2-4-1","ko":"도서관에서 어떤 책 빌렸어?","zh":"你在图书馆借了什么书？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"도서관에서","meaning":"图书馆","explanation":"도서관：图书馆；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"도서관","audio":"/audio/9ee22c8536d3503a4b1c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40295","senseId":"1","lemma":"도서관","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"도서관에서","audio":"/audio/6705409cf4453cc9226f.mp3"}},{"text":"어떤","meaning":"哪一个","explanation":"어떤：哪一个","readings":[{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17185","senseId":"2","lemma":"어떤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}},{"text":"책","meaning":"书，书籍，画册","explanation":"책：书，书籍，画册","readings":[{"term":"책","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71468","senseId":"1","lemma":"책","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"책","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3"}},{"text":"빌렸어?","meaning":"借","explanation":"빌리다：借；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"빌리다","audio":"/audio/7cc8358d972a7f6932ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17824","senseId":"1","lemma":"빌리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빌렸어","audio":"/audio/f4d535f570d69169d565.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9ee22c8536d3503a","term":"도서관","zh":"图书馆","audio":"/audio/9ee22c8536d3503a4b1c.mp3","entryId":"40295","definition":"收藏大量书籍和资料等，以供人们借阅或学习而建造的设施。","pronunciation":["도서관"]},{"id":"a0307911a0fb4256","term":"어떤","zh":"哪一个","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3","entryId":"17185","definition":"用于询问在现有的多个人或事物中，作为对象的是什么。","pronunciation":["어떤"]},{"id":"ba928dd573a2db9e","term":"책","zh":"书，书籍，画册","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3","entryId":"71468","definition":"把文章或画印刷之后装订成册而成的物品。","pronunciation":["책"]},{"id":"7cc8358d972a7f69","term":"빌리다","zh":"借","audio":"/audio/7cc8358d972a7f6932ef.mp3","entryId":"17824","definition":"一定时间内使用别人的东西或钱等，并约定事后还回或支付代价。","pronunciation":["빌리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e2d56054ce009f36aab2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n61757-2-4-2","ko":"시험에 필요한 책들만 빼내 왔어.","zh":"我只拿了考试需要的书而已。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"시험에","meaning":"考试","explanation":"시험：考试；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"시험","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20233","senseId":"1","lemma":"시험","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시험에","audio":"/audio/6e08c695baae36fe0f89.mp3"}},{"text":"필요한","meaning":"必需，必要","explanation":"필요하다：必需，必要；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"필요하다","audio":"/audio/b98947c9698402e3d07e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46945","senseId":"1","lemma":"필요하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"필요한","audio":"/audio/801d19a8a024b12dd6e4.mp3"}},{"text":"책들만","meaning":"书，书籍，画册","explanation":"책：书，书籍，画册；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"책","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71468","senseId":"1","lemma":"책","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"책들만","audio":"/audio/3a7bada4cf595c4e4a90.mp3"}},{"text":"빼내","meaning":"挑出，选出","explanation":"빼내다：挑出，选出；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"빼내다","audio":"/audio/615222c350c69dba19aa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61757","senseId":"2","lemma":"빼내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빼내","audio":"/audio/773f919ebd2ccdff8ca9.mp3"}},{"text":"왔어.","meaning":"到，来到","explanation":"오다：到，来到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"10","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왔어","aud